size_class = "colossal"
personality = "mysterious"
description = "Magmole's Ascended Form: a squared four-legged colossus of black volcanic glass. Its armour plates float a hand's width clear of its body and turn slowly around it, and the gaps between them glow with pale geometric seams. No wings, no horns, no tail club — it moves like a mountain that has decided to walk."
personality_text = "Quiet and unhurried. Obsidra answers slowly, lowers its head for those it trusts, and leaves a faint ring of cooled glass wherever it has stood."
